        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan names rust flower Gu as the reason that discovery is unsurprising. He states that Tie clan stores the Gu in the souls of Tie clansmen, and that whoever kills Tie clansmen is stained with its formless fragrance.",
